        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from wood, at distillation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from wood, at distillation
The inventory for "ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from biomass, at distillation, SE" is modelled with ethanol production from Scandinavian softwood. The mix is assumed with the Swiss situation of ethanol production in the year 2009.;
UUID: 205025c5-2d87-3323-b579-eaeb57f9eb19
Dewatering of ethanol 95% in H2O made from Scandinavian wood.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the production in Sweden.
Technology: Production of ethanol from Scandinavian softwood chips.
Time period: Nicht spezifiziert
Production volume: World ethanol production was around 276 Mio hl in 2003.
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_205025c5-2d87-3323-b579-eaeb57f9eb19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
